(3683813, 518114, 53964, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but high noise due to the low light. Noiseware is a good free program, or I''ve found that, in Photoshop CS at least, under "blur" is "surface blur". I use it at low settings, such as about 6 and 6, to clean up noise without losing detail. Hope this helps :)</td>', 'Good idea, but high noise due to the low light. Noiseware is a good free program, or I''ve found that, in Photoshop CS at least, under "blur" is "surface blur". I use it at low settings, such as about 6 and 6, to clean up noise without losing detail. Hope this helps :)', '2007-05-23 02:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
