(3684168, 518112, 6999, '<td valign="top">Having just waded through the slough of clichés in the smooth results, this is such a refreshing change. Dynamic, intriguing; very well done.</td>', 'Having just waded through the slough of clichés in the smooth results, this is such a refreshing change. Dynamic, intriguing; very well done.', '2007-05-23 04:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
