(3684201, 518234, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a certain appeal - though i think you''ve cramped her a touch with the figure in the background: it''s that relationship that seems interesting to me in this image.</td>', 'Has a certain appeal - though i think you''ve cramped her a touch with the figure in the background: it''s that relationship that seems interesting to me in this image.', '2007-05-23 05:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684203, 514114, 19961, '<td valign="top">Not sharp, compostion not the best</td>', 'Not sharp, compostion not the best', '2007-05-23 05:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684205, 515890, 66932, '<td valign="top">That is a stunning picture! 10</td>', 'That is a stunning picture! 10', '2007-05-23 05:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684206, 517526, 6999, '<td valign="top">The dynamic range seems terribly cramped in this; despite the sunl;igt it feels quite flat, and the lens distortion is pretty strong given the apparent width of the scene.</td>', 'The dynamic range seems terribly cramped in this; despite the sunl;igt it feels quite flat, and the lens distortion is pretty strong given the apparent width of the scene.', '2007-05-23 05:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684210, 518655, 66932, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2007-05-23 05:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684213, 516801, 19961, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better without the feet in the picture, but nice idea and well performed</td>', 'I think it would have been better without the feet in the picture, but nice idea and well performed', '2007-05-23 05:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684215, 516143, 6999, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''d have cropped tighter, to remove the edges of the tablet; but then, I wouldn''t have taken this shot at all. To me, you see, it''s just a thing, and you''ve taken a photograph of it - I don''t see the point of that.</td>', 'Personally, I''d have cropped tighter, to remove the edges of the tablet; but then, I wouldn''t have taken this shot at all. To me, you see, it''s just a thing, and you''ve taken a photograph of it - I don''t see the point of that.', '2007-05-23 05:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684216, 517359, 19961, '<td valign="top">I like this very much and brilliant idea for the user name :)</td>', 'I like this very much and brilliant idea for the user name :)', '2007-05-23 05:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684218, 513746, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beyond the weirdness of focus - which is <i>really</i> weird - I don''t get much from this; I''m happy to believe it''s just beyond me, and I''d be interested to know what you yourself like about it.</td>', 'Beyond the weirdness of focus - which is really weird - I don''t get much from this; I''m happy to believe it''s just beyond me, and I''d be interested to know what you yourself like about it.', '2007-05-23 05:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684220, 514195, 6999, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s a baseball. It has a blue background. It''s ''technically'' more than competent, a very assured display. But it isn''t, to my eyes, <i>interesting</i>.</td>', 'Yep, it''s a baseball. It has a blue background. It''s ''technically'' more than competent, a very assured display. But it isn''t, to my eyes, interesting.', '2007-05-23 05:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684221, 518180, 19961, '<td valign="top">Looking at the box, I''m not sure I would eat that ;)  To improve the picture I think I would look out a bit for the background, perhaps taking the picture a bit more from above?  Other than that a good capture and nice idea from the user name.</td>', 'Looking at the box, I''m not sure I would eat that ;)  To improve the picture I think I would look out a bit for the background, perhaps taking the picture a bit more from above?  Other than that a good capture and nice idea from the user name.', '2007-05-23 05:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684222, 514025, 19961, '<td valign="top">Very nice, light a bit harsh perhaps?</td>', 'Very nice, light a bit harsh perhaps?', '2007-05-23 05:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684224, 517809, 19961, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture! To bad about the background :(</td>', 'Fantastic capture! To bad about the background :(', '2007-05-23 05:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684225, 517503, 6999, '<td valign="top">Leaving aside the trick-photography impression of IR shots, this is a pleasant scene; as relaxing a place as one could hope to while away a few hours with a good book. Not sure I''ve much interest in looking at a photo of it though, but I guess it''ll score well.</td>', 'Leaving aside the trick-photography impression of IR shots, this is a pleasant scene; as relaxing a place as one could hope to while away a few hours with a good book. Not sure I''ve much interest in looking at a photo of it though, but I guess it''ll score well.', '2007-05-23 05:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684227, 517306, 19961, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, well done!  I don''t imagine it will do well, but i should!</td>', 'I like this very much, well done!  I don''t imagine it will do well, but i should!', '2007-05-23 05:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684230, 514259, 6999, '<td valign="top">Simply for the slight madness of it - the angle, the humdrum, the ''whay would anyone shoot this?'' kind of feel, I like it. A quite intriguing nothing-much-happening shot.</td>', 'Simply for the slight madness of it - the angle, the humdrum, the ''whay would anyone shoot this?'' kind of feel, I like it. A quite intriguing nothing-much-happening shot.', '2007-05-23 05:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684240, 518388, 69966, '<td valign="top">seems a little dark.</td>', 'seems a little dark.', '2007-05-23 06:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684242, 517638, 19961, '<td valign="top">Artistic, but a tad much for my taste.  But I applaud the use of some artistic creativity here on DPC, well done!</td>', 'Artistic, but a tad much for my taste.  But I applaud the use of some artistic creativity here on DPC, well done!', '2007-05-23 06:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684243, 517310, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well composed image, although it might perhaps have had more impact in mono.</td>', 'Well composed image, although it might perhaps have had more impact in mono.', '2007-05-23 06:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684250, 517340, 19961, '<td valign="top">Oooh, well done!</td>', 'Oooh, well done!', '2007-05-23 06:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684254, 518737, 19961, '<td valign="top">Perhaps better without the fingers in the picture? Still nicely done!</td>', 'Perhaps better without the fingers in the picture? Still nicely done!', '2007-05-23 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684287, 518388, 19961, '<td valign="top">Way to dark, out of focus etc.</td>', 'Way to dark, out of focus etc.', '2007-05-23 06:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684309, 518219, 37320, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I think your title could have pulled it off with just the username, but it doesn''t take away from the majesty of this picture.</td>', 'Great shot, I think your title could have pulled it off with just the username, but it doesn''t take away from the majesty of this picture.', '2007-05-23 06:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684311, 518737, 37320, '<td valign="top">Nifty colors</td>', 'Nifty colors', '2007-05-23 06:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684315, 519032, 37320, '<td valign="top">pretty Abstract editing, but suits the name nicely, overall well done.</td>', 'pretty Abstract editing, but suits the name nicely, overall well done.', '2007-05-23 06:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684318, 518802, 37320, '<td valign="top">I think some more saturation, or a more colorful background would help you out a whole lot.  Your dog is a great model and your composition and timing is excellent in my honest opinion.</td>', 'I think some more saturation, or a more colorful background would help you out a whole lot.  Your dog is a great model and your composition and timing is excellent in my honest opinion.', '2007-05-23 06:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684323, 517152, 37320, '<td valign="top">Vibrant shot! I love it</td>', 'Vibrant shot! I love it', '2007-05-23 06:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684326, 517780, 37320, '<td valign="top">Hahah look at its expression!</td>', 'Hahah look at its expression!', '2007-05-23 06:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684329, 515137, 37320, '<td valign="top">Wow, good timing for this shot.</td>', 'Wow, good timing for this shot.', '2007-05-23 06:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684332, 518257, 37320, '<td valign="top">I like how the ball is colored so distinctly and I think the only flaws in this shot are from you camera itself, not from any compositional error.</td>', 'I like how the ball is colored so distinctly and I think the only flaws in this shot are from you camera itself, not from any compositional error.', '2007-05-23 06:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684334, 518114, 67671, '<td valign="top">i did a shot like that once, with a little squert of lighter fuel, and the plete cracked in two, and the fire went onto the table, used a bit too much i supose, nice idea, crop is a little tight, and is a bit grainy</td>', 'i did a shot like that once, with a little squert of lighter fuel, and the plete cracked in two, and the fire went onto the table, used a bit too much i supose, nice idea, crop is a little tight, and is a bit grainy', '2007-05-23 07:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684341, 518767, 35352, '<td valign="top">a little grainy. I like the colours of the sunset. maybe a picture of someone staring at the sun and their reaction might of been better.</td>', 'a little grainy. I like the colours of the sunset. maybe a picture of someone staring at the sun and their reaction might of been better.', '2007-05-23 07:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684343, 515263, 35352, '<td valign="top">the most saturated colour is the green - i guess the lighting wasn''t in your favour. You''ve framed this really nicely.</td>', 'the most saturated colour is the green - i guess the lighting wasn''t in your favour. You''ve framed this really nicely.', '2007-05-23 07:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684346, 515474, 35352, '<td valign="top">very creative. the wooden figures look lifelike. I think the lighting hasn''t done you justice - its made for flat photo.</td>', 'very creative. the wooden figures look lifelike. I think the lighting hasn''t done you justice - its made for flat photo.', '2007-05-23 07:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684352, 517926, 35352, '<td valign="top">beautiful! that a great shade of blue in the sky and I like the strip of yellow on the horizon. The grass is just a little too dark though.</td>', 'beautiful! that a great shade of blue in the sky and I like the strip of yellow on the horizon. The grass is just a little too dark though.', '2007-05-23 07:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684355, 518807, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition. the trail of the hammer gives some great action to the photo.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition. the trail of the hammer gives some great action to the photo.', '2007-05-23 07:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684357, 518746, 35352, '<td valign="top">good work capturing this through what I assume was a very dirty airplane window. I like the different areas of the photo - more than more thing to look at.</td>', 'good work capturing this through what I assume was a very dirty airplane window. I like the different areas of the photo - more than more thing to look at.', '2007-05-23 07:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684362, 514442, 35352, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and soft tones. The eyes of the girl need some sharper focus. the b+w really suits the photo.</td>', 'nice lighting and soft tones. The eyes of the girl need some sharper focus. the b+w really suits the photo.', '2007-05-23 07:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684366, 518675, 35352, '<td valign="top">nice colours - I love the shades of blue of the sky. I also like the DOF but my eyes really want to see some larger buttercups - to see what they''re like.</td>', 'nice colours - I love the shades of blue of the sky. I also like the DOF but my eyes really want to see some larger buttercups - to see what they''re like.', '2007-05-23 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684379, 516505, 35352, '<td valign="top">13? A background of a different colour may of been better - though I have just seen a lot of very nice blue backgrounds - maybe I''m biased. I like the detail on the left of the front leaf and wish it was the same for all the 3 leaves.</td>', '13? A background of a different colour may of been better - though I have just seen a lot of very nice blue backgrounds - maybe I''m biased. I like the detail on the left of the front leaf and wish it was the same for all the 3 leaves.', '2007-05-23 07:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684385, 518959, 35352, '<td valign="top">needs some more contrast. da boarder girl is a little lost in the grass. maybe a landscape shot would of been better</td>', 'needs some more contrast. da boarder girl is a little lost in the grass. maybe a landscape shot would of been better', '2007-05-23 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684396, 518064, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the fire spurt you''ve captured. the white balance is a little off - seems a bit blue. the top of the car is cut off nearly at its boundary. a good frozen action shot.</td>', 'I like the fire spurt you''ve captured. the white balance is a little off - seems a bit blue. the top of the car is cut off nearly at its boundary. a good frozen action shot.', '2007-05-23 07:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684399, 514114, 35352, '<td valign="top">I won''t mention the obvious - I''ve resisted. this is framed very nicely though you could even have a bit more room on the right - its usually the rule to show areas where the subject is looking.</td>', 'I won''t mention the obvious - I''ve resisted. this is framed very nicely though you could even have a bit more room on the right - its usually the rule to show areas where the subject is looking.', '2007-05-23 07:26:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3684414, 517488, 35352, '<td valign="top">nice duotone photo. I think it need tighter cropping to get rid of some distracting elements - the gutter on the bottom, the dark corder on the right. I like the texture of the wall that contrasts with the smooth concrete parts. Unfortunately, you''ve subject is very dark in lighting compared to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'nice duotone photo. I think it need tighter cropping to get rid of some distracting elements - the gutter on the bottom, the dark corder on the right. I like the texture of the wall that contrasts with the smooth concrete parts. Unfortunately, you''ve subject is very dark in lighting compared to the rest of the photo.', '2007-05-23 07:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684425, 517999, 35352, '<td valign="top">fantastic! I like the angle you''ve taken this photo from. while I''m not sure about the blurry parts, they do add to the dream like qualities of the photo. There is a blue twinge to the man. I love the sky - nice shade of blue with just the right amount of stars!</td>', 'fantastic! I like the angle you''ve taken this photo from. while I''m not sure about the blurry parts, they do add to the dream like qualities of the photo. There is a blue twinge to the man. I love the sky - nice shade of blue with just the right amount of stars!', '2007-05-23 07:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684428, 515917, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the raw quality of this photo. The character of the bucker is told through the surroundings. You could crop tighter on the right to cut out the foliage - this would also make the bucket larger and more prominent.</td>', 'I like the raw quality of this photo. The character of the bucker is told through the surroundings. You could crop tighter on the right to cut out the foliage - this would also make the bucket larger and more prominent.', '2007-05-23 07:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684432, 518499, 35352, '<td valign="top">a beauty horse photo. The contrast really brings the house out well against the background. The focus just seems a tad soft on the horse - its ok on the legs showing the motion but on the face, its just a little blurry.</td>', 'a beauty horse photo. The contrast really brings the house out well against the background. The focus just seems a tad soft on the horse - its ok on the legs showing the motion but on the face, its just a little blurry.', '2007-05-23 07:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684437, 517660, 62554, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Perpetual motion the longer you look at it.</td>', 'Stunning!  Perpetual motion the longer you look at it.', '2007-05-23 07:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684449, 518242, 66241, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!!', '2007-05-23 07:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3684452, 517758, 66241, '<td valign="top">So sweet!</td>', 'So sweet!', '2007-05-23 07:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
