(3685450, 518737, 61961, '<td valign="top">Kim, I think this is beautiful!  It is very strong, graphics-wise.  I''m not generally a fan of tinting, but I think it works well in this case (and also took care of the minor issue of the red rim around the bulb).  The presence of the hand keeps adds humanity.  No improvements to offer, none needed.  If people are in their right minds this will score high.  Sincerely, Larry</td>', 'Kim, I think this is beautiful!  It is very strong, graphics-wise.  I''m not generally a fan of tinting, but I think it works well in this case (and also took care of the minor issue of the red rim around the bulb).  The presence of the hand keeps adds humanity.  No improvements to offer, none needed.  If people are in their right minds this will score high.  Sincerely, Larry', '2007-05-23 11:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
