(3685591, 514114, 46314, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a great shot. The composition is really good: lots of parallel lines (the waves, her arms, and the bands on her costume) create a rhythm. The colours are nice: vivid and with a nice range of blues. And the pose and droplets of water create a sense of action and add excitement to the pic. Not to mention a good looking subject.<br/>But critically, the focus is off, and that ruins the whole pic. Still, a worthy entry. Keep trying.</td>', 'This has the makings of a great shot. The composition is really good: lots of parallel lines (the waves, her arms, and the bands on her costume) create a rhythm. The colours are nice: vivid and with a nice range of blues. And the pose and droplets of water create a sense of action and add excitement to the pic. Not to mention a good looking subject.But critically, the focus is off, and that ruins the whole pic. Still, a worthy entry. Keep trying.', '2007-05-23 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
