(3690068, 514019, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, not everyone has camels in their neck of the woods!  Something about this image just doesn''t "pop" for me.  I''m not crazy about the tree behind the camel for one thing. I understand that there were probably issues with trying to get a different angle on the camel, and I can sure appreciate that, but this particular image the little something extra that would make it special.</td>', 'Wow, not everyone has camels in their neck of the woods!  Something about this image just doesn''t "pop" for me.  I''m not crazy about the tree behind the camel for one thing. I understand that there were probably issues with trying to get a different angle on the camel, and I can sure appreciate that, but this particular image the little something extra that would make it special.', '2007-05-24 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690073, 518499, 2553, '<td valign="top">Black and white would seem the perfect choice for this image, and the image is certainly perfect for the challenge.  A lovely capture of this beautiful horse.</td>', 'Black and white would seem the perfect choice for this image, and the image is certainly perfect for the challenge.  A lovely capture of this beautiful horse.', '2007-05-24 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
