(3690104, 518485, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors, and a good choice of image for the username you chose! Focus seems soft to me, and I would really like to see the balloon look a bit sharper.  I think I would have cropped a bit off the bottom - the image feels a little "bottom heavy" to me.</td>', 'Nice warm colors, and a good choice of image for the username you chose! Focus seems soft to me, and I would really like to see the balloon look a bit sharper.  I think I would have cropped a bit off the bottom - the image feels a little "bottom heavy" to me.', '2007-05-24 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690126, 516291, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though the image certainly fits the username that you chose, the image really just doesn''t tell me much.  It looks almost like he just ran out of the house to have his photo taken with the tuba. Period.  I would have enjoyed seeing this in a different context: marching with a band, even walking down a busy street attracting all kinds of attention, or standing on a streetcorner playing for a small crowd.</td>', 'Though the image certainly fits the username that you chose, the image really just doesn''t tell me much.  It looks almost like he just ran out of the house to have his photo taken with the tuba. Period.  I would have enjoyed seeing this in a different context: marching with a band, even walking down a busy street attracting all kinds of attention, or standing on a streetcorner playing for a small crowd.', '2007-05-24 09:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690153, 516863, 2553, '<td valign="top">Well, the background color really threw me; it almost hurts my eyes, but I do like the way you composed the shot.  The pod, though, is very interesting.  I''ve never seen anything like it, and wish there were more detail - more of a macro shot I guess.  It certainly fits the username!</td>', 'Well, the background color really threw me; it almost hurts my eyes, but I do like the way you composed the shot.  The pod, though, is very interesting.  I''ve never seen anything like it, and wish there were more detail - more of a macro shot I guess.  It certainly fits the username!', '2007-05-24 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690157, 517276, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot! So many things come to mind - tranquility, serenity, warmth, the absolute Glory of God.  Just beautiful.  Now that I''m back for a second look, I think it needs to be bumped up.</td>', 'What a lovely shot! So many things come to mind - tranquility, serenity, warmth, the absolute Glory of God.  Just beautiful.  Now that I''m back for a second look, I think it needs to be bumped up.', '2007-05-24 09:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690164, 513628, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but feels so cold!  Unique execution of the concept, and it works well.</td>', 'Lovely, but feels so cold!  Unique execution of the concept, and it works well.', '2007-05-24 10:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690169, 518398, 2553, '<td valign="top">A really nice image with breath-taking dof, and though I usually don''t think this - the border really adds to the image.  It gives it that little something extra that takes the image up a notch.</td>', 'A really nice image with breath-taking dof, and though I usually don''t think this - the border really adds to the image.  It gives it that little something extra that takes the image up a notch.', '2007-05-24 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690176, 518457, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely portrays the username you chose!  The foreground looks almost desaturated to me, and in the extreme foreground feels a bit "muddy".  The colors are beautiful though, and the concept comes through.</td>', 'Absolutely portrays the username you chose!  The foreground looks almost desaturated to me, and in the extreme foreground feels a bit "muddy".  The colors are beautiful though, and the concept comes through.', '2007-05-24 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690185, 516161, 2553, '<td valign="top">I almost think the choice of coloring on this image really makes it.  I get the concept, and the presentation does tell the story.  The single thing detracting from this image, for me, is that big fat weed that''s sticking up by his head.  This image has an almost indefinable delicacy to it that is negated by that weed.  Very interesting image.</td>', 'I almost think the choice of coloring on this image really makes it.  I get the concept, and the presentation does tell the story.  The single thing detracting from this image, for me, is that big fat weed that''s sticking up by his head.  This image has an almost indefinable delicacy to it that is negated by that weed.  Very interesting image.', '2007-05-24 10:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
