(3691410, 517716, 56167, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2007-05-24 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691414, 517961, 67152, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could really use some tonemapping.  The colors seem oversaturated and the sky is completely blown out.  Use of Photomatix Pro or other to show the detail in the tree trunk and not end up with a blown out sky might work really well on this image.</td>', 'This looks like it could really use some tonemapping.  The colors seem oversaturated and the sky is completely blown out.  Use of Photomatix Pro or other to show the detail in the tree trunk and not end up with a blown out sky might work really well on this image.', '2007-05-24 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691417, 515679, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the vista here but the centered horizon makes this just an average shot - you really have great colors and teh details are well done. 5</td>', 'i really like the vista here but the centered horizon makes this just an average shot - you really have great colors and teh details are well done. 5', '2007-05-24 16:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691418, 517400, 56167, '<td valign="top">He looks a real Pro.  :-)</td>', 'He looks a real Pro.  :-)', '2007-05-24 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691437, 519029, 67152, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge but I see a couple of flaws in this image that may should be easy fixes and help out your score - first the image seems a little underexposed - adjusting levels in photoshot should help brightenup up the whites a little.  second - the centered composition is not very interesting - shooting so the bird is off center will help - third the image seems a bit blurry - try setting up a tripod so it is pointed right at the birdfeeder to get shots of these little guys.</td>', 'Meets challenge but I see a couple of flaws in this image that may should be easy fixes and help out your score - first the image seems a little underexposed - adjusting levels in photoshot should help brightenup up the whites a little.  second - the centered composition is not very interesting - shooting so the bird is off center will help - third the image seems a bit blurry - try setting up a tripod so it is pointed right at the birdfeeder to get shots of these little guys.', '2007-05-24 16:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
