(3691718, 515310, 52521, '<td valign="top">Ok, I really know how hard those shots are since I''ve done a few myself. It looks like you''ve shaken the glass to get the splash effect and didn''t have the shutter fast enough to completely freeze the glass, Keep working on it :) also the glass is tilted a little, you could fix that by cropping a little differently :)</td>', 'Ok, I really know how hard those shots are since I''ve done a few myself. It looks like you''ve shaken the glass to get the splash effect and didn''t have the shutter fast enough to completely freeze the glass, Keep working on it :) also the glass is tilted a little, you could fix that by cropping a little differently :)', '2007-05-24 17:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
