(3692306, 518891, 57965, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little off.  The reflection in the upper left hand corner of the glass is a little distracting.  Perhaps displaying the product with more of a story could help.  Even having the glass over-flowing could tell a bit more of the story.  Keep at it!</td>', 'Focus is a little off.  The reflection in the upper left hand corner of the glass is a little distracting.  Perhaps displaying the product with more of a story could help.  Even having the glass over-flowing could tell a bit more of the story.  Keep at it!', '2007-05-24 20:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692309, 514705, 57965, '<td valign="top">Love how the dragonfly is so vertical in contrast to its surroundings.  Nice approach.</td>', 'Love how the dragonfly is so vertical in contrast to its surroundings.  Nice approach.', '2007-05-24 20:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692314, 516083, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Subject''s hat/clothing is a little detracting from the impact of the picture.  Nice work, nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Subject''s hat/clothing is a little detracting from the impact of the picture.  Nice work, nonetheless.', '2007-05-24 21:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692323, 513336, 57965, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, the photo feels cliche.  The quality of the photo distracts from the message - too much noise.<br/>Perhaps having the subject placed differently in the photo.  Maybe in the distance and in the mist could have told a different story?</td>', 'Compositionally, the photo feels cliche.  The quality of the photo distracts from the message - too much noise.Perhaps having the subject placed differently in the photo.  Maybe in the distance and in the mist could have told a different story?', '2007-05-24 21:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692326, 516298, 57965, '<td valign="top">The photo feels like it ends abruptly.  If there were more space on the left side of the photo, it would have helped to give the impression that the bird has space to travel.</td>', 'The photo feels like it ends abruptly.  If there were more space on the left side of the photo, it would have helped to give the impression that the bird has space to travel.', '2007-05-24 21:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692331, 516126, 57965, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be a clear indication of what the centre of visual impact is.  An alternative would have been to make the photo symmetrical, with the two subjects mirroring each other.  Good try!</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be a clear indication of what the centre of visual impact is.  An alternative would have been to make the photo symmetrical, with the two subjects mirroring each other.  Good try!', '2007-05-24 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
