(3692336, 519032, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  No-parking sign is distracting - too bad you couldn''t clone it out.</td>', 'Nice concept.  No-parking sign is distracting - too bad you couldn''t clone it out.', '2007-05-24 21:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692347, 518995, 57965, '<td valign="top">Without the title, it would be difficult to discern what the subject really was.  Cloudy sky could be more dramatic with more contrast.</td>', 'Without the title, it would be difficult to discern what the subject really was.  Cloudy sky could be more dramatic with more contrast.', '2007-05-24 21:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692354, 518782, 57965, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Nice DOF, great subject expression.</td>', 'Very nice.  Nice DOF, great subject expression.', '2007-05-24 21:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692360, 518252, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and leading line.  Something about the focus detracts from the photo.  Too sharp in some places? (can''t put my finger on it.)  Either way, good work.</td>', 'Nice composition and leading line.  Something about the focus detracts from the photo.  Too sharp in some places? (can''t put my finger on it.)  Either way, good work.', '2007-05-24 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692361, 518649, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Great expression.</td>', 'Nice capture!  Great expression.', '2007-05-24 21:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692375, 519021, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice visualization.  One suggestion would be to have a harsher light or more contrast, it could help give a greater depth to the layers of pasta.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice visualization.  One suggestion would be to have a harsher light or more contrast, it could help give a greater depth to the layers of pasta.  Nice work.', '2007-05-24 21:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692379, 516210, 57965, '<td valign="top">Too central/static.  Feels like a nice ''snapshot'', but needs more of a story to make it a ''photo''.</td>', 'Too central/static.  Feels like a nice ''snapshot'', but needs more of a story to make it a ''photo''.', '2007-05-24 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692390, 517584, 57965, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!  Nice use of lighting and composition.  Made me laugh.  Deep down inside, I fear the pasta is actually bitterly cold. :)  Great work, keep it up.</td>', 'Awesome!!  Nice use of lighting and composition.  Made me laugh.  Deep down inside, I fear the pasta is actually bitterly cold. :)  Great work, keep it up.', '2007-05-24 21:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692395, 517163, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Great reflection and evening shot.  One thing though, if the main subject were the ''sun'', it doesn''t seem to draw the viewer to the sun.  (it''s too far out in the frame.)</td>', 'Nice photo.  Great reflection and evening shot.  One thing though, if the main subject were the ''sun'', it doesn''t seem to draw the viewer to the sun.  (it''s too far out in the frame.)', '2007-05-24 21:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692412, 515917, 57965, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.', '2007-05-24 21:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692415, 517486, 57965, '<td valign="top">So simple and minimalistic, that it''s awesome.  Great work!</td>', 'So simple and minimalistic, that it''s awesome.  Great work!', '2007-05-24 21:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692417, 518216, 57965, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!  Great concept and message.  Great work.</td>', 'Made me laugh!  Great concept and message.  Great work.', '2007-05-24 21:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692423, 518746, 57965, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Simply breath-taking.  Great work!</td>', 'Wow.  Simply breath-taking.  Great work!', '2007-05-24 21:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692430, 514829, 57965, '<td valign="top">A little too tight on the crop.  The title, ''indinzfan'', has ''fan''.  If you recomposed and got the fans, and their reactions and emotions, you could have told a much stronger story.  Good capture, nonetheless.</td>', 'A little too tight on the crop.  The title, ''indinzfan'', has ''fan''.  If you recomposed and got the fans, and their reactions and emotions, you could have told a much stronger story.  Good capture, nonetheless.', '2007-05-24 21:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692434, 517908, 52521, '<td valign="top">Sexy :)</td>', 'Sexy :)', '2007-05-24 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692437, 518957, 57965, '<td valign="top">There are too many distractions in the photo.  The lines of his shirt, the coffee-mate and sugar, the dark shadow under his arm, his tie etc.  If you recomposed and drew in tighter to the coffee, leaving enough detail to show there''s a guy wearing a tie, you could bring out a stronger message and in turn, make a stronger photo.</td>', 'There are too many distractions in the photo.  The lines of his shirt, the coffee-mate and sugar, the dark shadow under his arm, his tie etc.  If you recomposed and drew in tighter to the coffee, leaving enough detail to show there''s a guy wearing a tie, you could bring out a stronger message and in turn, make a stronger photo.', '2007-05-24 21:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692443, 514384, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Only one ''niggle''.  If there were a little fill light on the shot glass, it would help to distinguish it''s shape and what it is - just to show an edge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Only one ''niggle''.  If there were a little fill light on the shot glass, it would help to distinguish it''s shape and what it is - just to show an edge.', '2007-05-24 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692466, 517486, 60340, '<td valign="top">I like the clouds on the horizon</td>', 'I like the clouds on the horizon', '2007-05-24 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692472, 517400, 60340, '<td valign="top">Cool bear, and with the tie and waistcoat.</td>', 'Cool bear, and with the tie and waistcoat.', '2007-05-24 21:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692483, 515474, 57965, '<td valign="top">Very witty!  Good capture.</td>', 'Very witty!  Good capture.', '2007-05-24 22:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692492, 518959, 57965, '<td valign="top">A little too tight a crop.  If you could juxtapose the boarder and the mass expanse of non-snow, there''d be a stronger story.  Almost there, great potential.</td>', 'A little too tight a crop.  If you could juxtapose the boarder and the mass expanse of non-snow, there''d be a stronger story.  Almost there, great potential.', '2007-05-24 22:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692497, 516084, 57965, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the trunk on the right extends to a nice overhanging branch.  If it did, I would suggest including more of your surrounding to get a nice frame.  The dark tree would be a great frame into this bright green and colourful world beyond.</td>', 'Not sure if the trunk on the right extends to a nice overhanging branch.  If it did, I would suggest including more of your surrounding to get a nice frame.  The dark tree would be a great frame into this bright green and colourful world beyond.', '2007-05-24 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692502, 518397, 57965, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  Only suggestion would be a stronger backlight to really define the shape.  Otherwise, very clear message.  Good work!</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  Only suggestion would be a stronger backlight to really define the shape.  Otherwise, very clear message.  Good work!', '2007-05-24 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692515, 514025, 57965, '<td valign="top">Powerful imagery.  Good work!</td>', 'Powerful imagery.  Good work!', '2007-05-24 22:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692525, 513746, 57965, '<td valign="top">Focus is off, or unclear what the central subject is.</td>', 'Focus is off, or unclear what the central subject is.', '2007-05-24 22:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692527, 517584, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot for this contest.  Awesome photo, highest marks.</td>', 'What a fantastic shot for this contest.  Awesome photo, highest marks.', '2007-05-24 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692528, 517999, 57965, '<td valign="top">Awesome, awesome photo.  Just awesome.  Ribbon for sure!</td>', 'Awesome, awesome photo.  Just awesome.  Ribbon for sure!', '2007-05-24 22:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692537, 518457, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous scene.  Beautiful and meets the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'What a fabulous scene.  Beautiful and meets the challenge perfectly.', '2007-05-24 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692540, 517998, 57965, '<td valign="top">Symmetry is <i>almost</i> there.  Other than that, very good!</td>', 'Symmetry is almost there.  Other than that, very good!', '2007-05-24 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692561, 518258, 57965, '<td valign="top">Love the colour, DOF, composition, leading lines, it''s all there.  Textbook definition of an awesome photo!  Hope this gets a ribbon!</td>', 'Love the colour, DOF, composition, leading lines, it''s all there.  Textbook definition of an awesome photo!  Hope this gets a ribbon!', '2007-05-24 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692701, 517716, 77323, '<td valign="top">I like how it''s totally staring you down.</td>', 'I like how it''s totally staring you down.', '2007-05-24 23:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692987, 518307, 35352, '<td valign="top">I love the concentric circles and the tones they''ve created. The white balance needs slight adjustment - seems a little yellow esp in the clothes. I like who the photo brings attention to the pottery action. It''s like I''m standing right there.</td>', 'I love the concentric circles and the tones they''ve created. The white balance needs slight adjustment - seems a little yellow esp in the clothes. I like who the photo brings attention to the pottery action. It''s like I''m standing right there.', '2007-05-25 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3692997, 515351, 35352, '<td valign="top">cute. nice detail - esp the little hairs. I think it needs some more umph if you know what I mean - some more contrast maybe - the whites aren''t white.</td>', 'cute. nice detail - esp the little hairs. I think it needs some more umph if you know what I mean - some more contrast maybe - the whites aren''t white.', '2007-05-25 00:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693005, 518174, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well the execution isn''t quite there - it''s not as crisp as I''d like and the lighting is a bit harsh, but the concept is good and you get an extra point for the amusement factor. 7.</td>', 'Well the execution isn''t quite there - it''s not as crisp as I''d like and the lighting is a bit harsh, but the concept is good and you get an extra point for the amusement factor. 7.', '2007-05-25 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693011, 518485, 35352, '<td valign="top">great choice of subject to represent the username. the photo seems blurry though. A portrait shot of just the balloon and the reflection may have cut out  the buildings that distract a litte.</td>', 'great choice of subject to represent the username. the photo seems blurry though. A portrait shot of just the balloon and the reflection may have cut out  the buildings that distract a litte.', '2007-05-25 00:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693021, 517347, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp - very effective DOF. Seagulls just aren''t the most interesting subject, but you''ve done well with these.</td>', 'Nice and crisp - very effective DOF. Seagulls just aren''t the most interesting subject, but you''ve done well with these.', '2007-05-25 00:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693027, 518781, 35352, '<td valign="top">great duotone. I usually like my blacks black and whites white but I think the style you''ve gone for here. the vegetation is interesting too. I''m not sure about the crop - showing more of the surroundings may have given a more deserted feel.</td>', 'great duotone. I usually like my blacks black and whites white but I think the style you''ve gone for here. the vegetation is interesting too. I''m not sure about the crop - showing more of the surroundings may have given a more deserted feel.', '2007-05-25 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693029, 517124, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I think you''ll run into trouble perhaps on account of the fact there there is no rain involved in this image - but it''s a great catch nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'Great shot - I think you''ll run into trouble perhaps on account of the fact there there is no rain involved in this image - but it''s a great catch nonetheless. 7.', '2007-05-25 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693033, 518770, 35352, '<td valign="top">very imaginative. you''ve been brave with the DOF but I don''t think it''s worked - the knight is barely in focus and we can''t really see what its up against.</td>', 'very imaginative. you''ve been brave with the DOF but I don''t think it''s worked - the knight is barely in focus and we can''t really see what its up against.', '2007-05-25 00:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693036, 518399, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Would perhaps be improved with a deeper DOF so that the tree in the background was a bit crisper, but I do like the way the deer are isolated from everything else.</td>', 'Very pretty. Would perhaps be improved with a deeper DOF so that the tree in the background was a bit crisper, but I do like the way the deer are isolated from everything else.', '2007-05-25 00:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693041, 517961, 35352, '<td valign="top">This photo really goes with the username. I love it. overexposed and colours not quite right though.</td>', 'This photo really goes with the username. I love it. overexposed and colours not quite right though.', '2007-05-25 00:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693054, 518752, 35352, '<td valign="top">your camera has focused on the fence and not the dog. I like the look the dog is showing, he does look alone. showing more of the surroundings may have fitted your title better.</td>', 'your camera has focused on the fence and not the dog. I like the look the dog is showing, he does look alone. showing more of the surroundings may have fitted your title better.', '2007-05-25 00:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693058, 517550, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very retro feel. The lighting is a little out-of the box, but overall I think this is relatively effective. Having said that I would like to see more emphasis on the face and less on the torso. Also, the crop is a little strange at the bottom - I don''t know why you''ve cut the image so close to the bottom of the arm.</td>', 'Very retro feel. The lighting is a little out-of the box, but overall I think this is relatively effective. Having said that I would like to see more emphasis on the face and less on the torso. Also, the crop is a little strange at the bottom - I don''t know why you''ve cut the image so close to the bottom of the arm.', '2007-05-25 00:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693061, 516795, 35352, '<td valign="top">very cute. fits username perfectly. there seems to be a yellow cast to the photo though.</td>', 'very cute. fits username perfectly. there seems to be a yellow cast to the photo though.', '2007-05-25 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693067, 518497, 23458, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of shots in this challenge making use of this title. This one does a better job than most of capturing the particular theme - so well done on that level. I would say, however, that the girl''s pose does look slightly unnatural. Good lighting.</td>', 'There are a lot of shots in this challenge making use of this title. This one does a better job than most of capturing the particular theme - so well done on that level. I would say, however, that the girl''s pose does look slightly unnatural. Good lighting.', '2007-05-25 00:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693071, 517791, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt here - you''ve caught an interesting moment. However the shot is just not crisp enough. Furthermore, I think it could be improved greatly if you had employed a slightly lower perspective - the tiger would appear more menacing if you were looking accross or even slightly up at it.</td>', 'Nice attempt here - you''ve caught an interesting moment. However the shot is just not crisp enough. Furthermore, I think it could be improved greatly if you had employed a slightly lower perspective - the tiger would appear more menacing if you were looking accross or even slightly up at it.', '2007-05-25 00:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693088, 515310, 23458, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you''ve used an entire kiwi. The name is not ''4 pieces of a kiwi'' it is ''aKiwi''. 1. <br/> <br/>Just kidding. <br/> <br/>This is an effective image - good variation on what I expected to be a common theme in this challenge. On the constructive side, I think this would benefit if you rotated slightly so that the lip of the glass was level. ALso, it could perhaps be slightly crisper. 6.</td>', 'I don''t think you''ve used an entire kiwi. The name is not ''4 pieces of a kiwi'' it is ''aKiwi''. 1.  Just kidding.  This is an effective image - good variation on what I expected to be a common theme in this challenge. On the constructive side, I think this would benefit if you rotated slightly so that the lip of the glass was level. ALso, it could perhaps be slightly crisper. 6.', '2007-05-25 00:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693102, 515350, 23458, '<td valign="top">Stoic. Almost indignant. I am pregnant. I am Woman ... and I don''t care if you don''t like it. I would prefer a less contrived/less studio background perhaps but, on the whole, I like what you''ve done here. Well lit.</td>', 'Stoic. Almost indignant. I am pregnant. I am Woman ... and I don''t care if you don''t like it. I would prefer a less contrived/less studio background perhaps but, on the whole, I like what you''ve done here. Well lit.', '2007-05-25 00:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693122, 517638, 56658, '<td valign="top">who the hell dropped the nuke on that lighthouse:)</td>', 'who the hell dropped the nuke on that lighthouse:)', '2007-05-25 00:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693145, 516552, 49007, '<td valign="top">That''s a stretch...</td>', 'That''s a stretch...', '2007-05-25 00:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693151, 518180, 70514, '<td valign="top">How perfect is this?  VERY appropriate :)</td>', 'How perfect is this?  VERY appropriate :)', '2007-05-25 00:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693200, 518763, 23146, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and lighting, the only thing I don''t like is the background, probably a darker or liver color could enhance your picture. Also in the background you have a kind of blue circle which is distracting me.</td>', 'Nice DOF and lighting, the only thing I don''t like is the background, probably a darker or liver color could enhance your picture. Also in the background you have a kind of blue circle which is distracting me.', '2007-05-25 01:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693248, 518938, 49007, '<td valign="top">That stretching it a bit don''t you think?</td>', 'That stretching it a bit don''t you think?', '2007-05-25 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693249, 515682, 49007, '<td valign="top">Huh? I don''t understand how this image represents the username.</td>', 'Huh? I don''t understand how this image represents the username.', '2007-05-25 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693250, 517486, 49007, '<td valign="top">Where''s the comber? All I see is a beach.</td>', 'Where''s the comber? All I see is a beach.', '2007-05-25 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693251, 518988, 49007, '<td valign="top">Which one is he? There are crayons there! I know. I know. Nitpicking.</td>', 'Which one is he? There are crayons there! I know. I know. Nitpicking.', '2007-05-25 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693258, 518721, 49007, '<td valign="top">Quite a stretch on this one.</td>', 'Quite a stretch on this one.', '2007-05-25 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693268, 517926, 23146, '<td valign="top">Congratulation, very nice shot</td>', 'Congratulation, very nice shot', '2007-05-25 01:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693297, 515350, 49007, '<td valign="top">iamanunhappywoman?</td>', 'iamanunhappywoman?', '2007-05-25 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693298, 517498, 49007, '<td valign="top">Um, horse RIDER? Horse JOCKY? Wouldn''t a horse FAN be in the stands?</td>', 'Um, horse RIDER? Horse JOCKY? Wouldn''t a horse FAN be in the stands?', '2007-05-25 01:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693333, 518780, 78922, '<td valign="top">The username that goes with this picture fits perfectly. also, it just made me laugh.</td>', 'The username that goes with this picture fits perfectly. also, it just made me laugh.', '2007-05-25 02:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693364, 517306, 73601, '<td valign="top">very unique, really like this</td>', 'very unique, really like this', '2007-05-25 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693486, 514624, 16241, '<td valign="top">munch munch :)</td>', 'munch munch :)', '2007-05-25 03:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693493, 514025, 23458, '<td valign="top">Perhaps slightly too contrived, this shot works on account of the excellent lighting and startlingly raw subject matter.</td>', 'Perhaps slightly too contrived, this shot works on account of the excellent lighting and startlingly raw subject matter.', '2007-05-25 03:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693497, 518043, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus. However, the composition is not particularly interesting -it is definately too centered to be effective.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus. However, the composition is not particularly interesting -it is definately too centered to be effective.', '2007-05-25 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693501, 517812, 23458, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject - the lighting, however, is a bit flat. I would also like a slightly shallower DOF to separate the flowers from their background (which is, as it stands, a little distracting).</td>', 'Pretty subject - the lighting, however, is a bit flat. I would also like a slightly shallower DOF to separate the flowers from their background (which is, as it stands, a little distracting).', '2007-05-25 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693508, 518471, 23458, '<td valign="top">As much as I think the ice looks slightly out of place - even distracting, I''m sure you''ll do very well with this shot. It is a particularly striking landscape. 8.</td>', 'As much as I think the ice looks slightly out of place - even distracting, I''m sure you''ll do very well with this shot. It is a particularly striking landscape. 8.', '2007-05-25 03:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693515, 517306, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nobody indeed. Excellent. I''m irritated by the foot. Still...excellent. 8.</td>', 'Nobody indeed. Excellent. I''m irritated by the foot. Still...excellent. 8.', '2007-05-25 04:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693519, 518603, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent work here, my top pick!</td>', 'excellent work here, my top pick!', '2007-05-25 04:02:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3693523, 517908, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Sexy girl, nice costume. Solid lighting. Overall, however, it does seem a bit flat - perhaps that is attributable to the boring background - the pose/facial expression is also a bit static. You could have had yourself a ribbon if you''d shot this outside in an alleyway. Still, it has quite a bit going for it. 7.</td>', 'Very cute. Sexy girl, nice costume. Solid lighting. Overall, however, it does seem a bit flat - perhaps that is attributable to the boring background - the pose/facial expression is also a bit static. You could have had yourself a ribbon if you''d shot this outside in an alleyway. Still, it has quite a bit going for it. 7.', '2007-05-25 04:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693525, 518738, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehe. Priceless expression, terrific concept. A top ten or I''ll eat my viking helmet.</td>', 'Hehe. Priceless expression, terrific concept. A top ten or I''ll eat my viking helmet.', '2007-05-25 04:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693527, 517663, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I like it. 7...make that an 8.</td>', 'Very dramatic. I like it. 7...make that an 8.', '2007-05-25 04:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693533, 514264, 23458, '<td valign="top">A little cliche never hurt anyone. This shot is, as usual, professional Judi - but it just seems a little static - lacking the additional oomph required to push it over the top. Not bad, just not up to par with some of your more imaginative work.</td>', 'A little cliche never hurt anyone. This shot is, as usual, professional Judi - but it just seems a little static - lacking the additional oomph required to push it over the top. Not bad, just not up to par with some of your more imaginative work.', '2007-05-25 04:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693565, 518180, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!!!!  What a nice tribute to a wonderful lady.  Who would have thought the name was out there?<br/> <br/>Nice.</td>', 'Sweet!!!!!  What a nice tribute to a wonderful lady.  Who would have thought the name was out there? Nice.', '2007-05-25 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3693570, 513628, 32872, '<td valign="top">pretty!</td>', 'pretty!', '2007-05-25 04:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
