(3697017, 518257, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like how the bright orange colour here makes the basketball stand out! The photo looks a bit flat though - it needs some good lighting or contrast.</td>', 'I like how the bright orange colour here makes the basketball stand out! The photo looks a bit flat though - it needs some good lighting or contrast.', '2007-05-26 05:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697021, 518782, 35352, '<td valign="top">this really fits the username. Its framed quite well - maybe having the girl off center a bit would be better. The white dress seems blown out and the surrounding could use some more contrast. I like the expression on the face and the detail/exposure you have there.</td>', 'this really fits the username. Its framed quite well - maybe having the girl off center a bit would be better. The white dress seems blown out and the surrounding could use some more contrast. I like the expression on the face and the detail/exposure you have there.', '2007-05-26 05:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697025, 515492, 35352, '<td valign="top">great colours and an interesting photo. Spiderman is cropped a little too close to his body - needs a little more room on the top border.</td>', 'great colours and an interesting photo. Spiderman is cropped a little too close to his body - needs a little more room on the top border.', '2007-05-26 05:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697026, 518815, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. its a tiny bit overblown in parts but I like everything else about it: the detail, the subversive alcohol flask, the angle who''ve taken the subject.</td>', 'I like this alot. its a tiny bit overblown in parts but I like everything else about it: the detail, the subversive alcohol flask, the angle who''ve taken the subject.', '2007-05-26 05:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697027, 516677, 35352, '<td valign="top">a very nice swan. I think you need to get the whites closer to white without losing to the detail or overexposing it. Or maybe just increasing the contrast. Its a great photo though.</td>', 'a very nice swan. I think you need to get the whites closer to white without losing to the detail or overexposing it. Or maybe just increasing the contrast. Its a great photo though.', '2007-05-26 05:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
