(3697058, 517765, 35352, '<td valign="top">taken 10 minutes earlier, I think this would have been much better - we''d have more detail in the trees and not such a harsh sun.</td>', 'taken 10 minutes earlier, I think this would have been much better - we''d have more detail in the trees and not such a harsh sun.', '2007-05-26 06:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
