(3698568, 516337, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well, I get the feeling you''ll offend plenty with this title. Still, I couldn''t help but laugh out loud at it. So you''ve got an 8 from me. It just happens to be a pretty decent image technically too. I have to say though, there''s just not enough eye-makeup/facial piercings going on here.</td>', 'Well, I get the feeling you''ll offend plenty with this title. Still, I couldn''t help but laugh out loud at it. So you''ve got an 8 from me. It just happens to be a pretty decent image technically too. I have to say though, there''s just not enough eye-makeup/facial piercings going on here.', '2007-05-26 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3698582, 516167, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great photo! the green and orangy-red colours compliment each other. There''s great detail not just in the horse but in the grass and clouds. The horse is positioned well in the photo. I like the little animals on the horizon - they suddenly jump out at you. The only thing that could be better is the very hot left part of the sky. Unfortunately, it distracts for the rest of an otherwise brilliant photo.</td>', 'Great photo! the green and orangy-red colours compliment each other. There''s great detail not just in the horse but in the grass and clouds. The horse is positioned well in the photo. I like the little animals on the horizon - they suddenly jump out at you. The only thing that could be better is the very hot left part of the sky. Unfortunately, it distracts for the rest of an otherwise brilliant photo.', '2007-05-26 21:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3698589, 515871, 35352, '<td valign="top">Great idea. That blue is a great colour. There''s a mysterious yet calming sensation about this photo. I looks like you''ve blurred the clouds/sky which gives a good effect. The only thing I''d like to see different is more sharpening on the ends of the trees - I think the blurring/noise reduction has done a number on them too. A strong unsharp mask would do wonders here I think.</td>', 'Great idea. That blue is a great colour. There''s a mysterious yet calming sensation about this photo. I looks like you''ve blurred the clouds/sky which gives a good effect. The only thing I''d like to see different is more sharpening on the ends of the trees - I think the blurring/noise reduction has done a number on them too. A strong unsharp mask would do wonders here I think.', '2007-05-26 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3698594, 518588, 35352, '<td valign="top">Does not meet challenge.</td>', 'Does not meet challenge.', '2007-05-26 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
