(3699618, 518176, 50641, '<td valign="top">Goodness gracious.  This will have to ribbon, I''m guessing.  Incredible catch.</td>', 'Goodness gracious.  This will have to ribbon, I''m guessing.  Incredible catch.', '2007-05-27 04:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
