(3705956, 517631, 27556, '<td valign="top">the focuse seems soft and slightly pixelated on the Elks neck. I dont know if that came from the camera used or in post processing. Make sure that when you are editing you look at your image at its full size and check for that grainyness</td>', 'the focuse seems soft and slightly pixelated on the Elks neck. I dont know if that came from the camera used or in post processing. Make sure that when you are editing you look at your image at its full size and check for that grainyness', '2007-05-28 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3705957, 514384, 27556, '<td valign="top">mmmm yummy. Doesnt look like real JD to me though the liquid is too pale, JD has a VERY rich brown color.</td>', 'mmmm yummy. Doesnt look like real JD to me though the liquid is too pale, JD has a VERY rich brown color.', '2007-05-28 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
