(3705993, 514264, 27556, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so hard for me... I love catwoman... and Im a huge comic book fan... so when there are bad costumes it takes away a lot for me... so I am trying to look past that. (I have made my own cat woman costume in the past since I cant find any I would consider acceptable to put that in perspective) that aside... composition is nice, but this is not a great pose for catwoman, her leg looks a bit stumpy to me since her hand is blocking her knee it looks a little off. I love the effect the smoke has on this though. The lighting seems a bit harsh where is is bounding off the armlets. Over all an abover average shot, with some room for improvement.</td>', 'Oh this is so hard for me... I love catwoman... and Im a huge comic book fan... so when there are bad costumes it takes away a lot for me... so I am trying to look past that. (I have made my own cat woman costume in the past since I cant find any I would consider acceptable to put that in perspective) that aside... composition is nice, but this is not a great pose for catwoman, her leg looks a bit stumpy to me since her hand is blocking her knee it looks a little off. I love the effect the smoke has on this though. The lighting seems a bit harsh where is is bounding off the armlets. Over all an abover average shot, with some room for improvement.', '2007-05-28 19:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
