(3709313, 514259, 40973, '<td valign="top">I arrive, get out of the car, stretch and look around. Like a dream come true, there are no people in sight. I lean over the car to steady myself and camera. One snap and then the clouds unleash their rain down on me.<br/> <br/>Definitely looks like a place I would like to be right now.</td>', 'I arrive, get out of the car, stretch and look around. Like a dream come true, there are no people in sight. I lean over the car to steady myself and camera. One snap and then the clouds unleash their rain down on me. Definitely looks like a place I would like to be right now.', '2007-05-29 15:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
