(3709772, 517961, 57378, '<td valign="top">Slightly too contrasty - Maybe a person around the back with just their arms showing in the front hugging the tree could have had more impact. Great username.</td>', 'Slightly too contrasty - Maybe a person around the back with just their arms showing in the front hugging the tree could have had more impact. Great username.', '2007-05-29 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709777, 514721, 57378, '<td valign="top">Sky mountain it is - Has to be said though this would have been much stronger for the challenge (Not just a stand alone landscape) if the bottom right red field and river were cropped out. The red takes our eye away too much.</td>', 'Sky mountain it is - Has to be said though this would have been much stronger for the challenge (Not just a stand alone landscape) if the bottom right red field and river were cropped out. The red takes our eye away too much.', '2007-05-29 17:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
