(3709785, 515209, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light but needs something in there to hold the eye (A reflected plane or something) as it''s a tad boring.</td>', 'Nice soft light but needs something in there to hold the eye (A reflected plane or something) as it''s a tad boring.', '2007-05-29 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709792, 515492, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great spot - This could have been a winner if you were able to get someone to pose up for you - A young kid looking up right in the lower right hand corner close up would have put this into a great photograph not just a good photograph. Security guard is good for scale but looking out the wrong way really distracts from this great scene.</td>', 'Great spot - This could have been a winner if you were able to get someone to pose up for you - A young kid looking up right in the lower right hand corner close up would have put this into a great photograph not just a good photograph. Security guard is good for scale but looking out the wrong way really distracts from this great scene.', '2007-05-29 17:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709796, 515095, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice - Like the dramatic look of this and I am a Jurassic Park fan so you got me!</td>', 'Nice - Like the dramatic look of this and I am a Jurassic Park fan so you got me!', '2007-05-29 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709800, 518532, 57378, '<td valign="top">Shots like these need to be technically perfect and I am afraid this is not - Far too much camera shake and the composition needs work.</td>', 'Shots like these need to be technically perfect and I am afraid this is not - Far too much camera shake and the composition needs work.', '2007-05-29 17:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709802, 518990, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice simple crisp image.</td>', 'Nice simple crisp image.', '2007-05-29 17:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709804, 516337, 57378, '<td valign="top">I am not getting the username ref - Sorry</td>', 'I am not getting the username ref - Sorry', '2007-05-29 17:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709806, 517172, 57378, '<td valign="top">The background is far too distracting and it needs some more contrast to give it some punch. Nice exposure though</td>', 'The background is far too distracting and it needs some more contrast to give it some punch. Nice exposure though', '2007-05-29 17:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709820, 517501, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - I think this could have been improved dramatically by a couple of things - First the angle it was taken from - It''s very boring taken straight from a standing point. Getting real low and close to the wall with a wide angle could have added some much needed drama to this. Second the direct flash has made this look very flat. No flash would have helped. Also his choice of clothing matches the wall too much - A black and white conversion could have helped. Please don''t think this is all negative. I really like the shot but feel it really could have had much more impact on the viewer if just a few changes were made. Like I said - The viewpoint of the photographer could have given it so much more impact if you hadn''t shot it straight on.</td>', 'Nice idea - I think this could have been improved dramatically by a couple of things - First the angle it was taken from - It''s very boring taken straight from a standing point. Getting real low and close to the wall with a wide angle could have added some much needed drama to this. Second the direct flash has made this look very flat. No flash would have helped. Also his choice of clothing matches the wall too much - A black and white conversion could have helped. Please don''t think this is all negative. I really like the shot but feel it really could have had much more impact on the viewer if just a few changes were made. Like I said - The viewpoint of the photographer could have given it so much more impact if you hadn''t shot it straight on.', '2007-05-29 17:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709822, 517381, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.</td>', 'Nice and simple.', '2007-05-29 17:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709823, 515108, 57378, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a tad too much PP on this.</td>', 'Maybe just a tad too much PP on this.', '2007-05-29 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
