(3719992, 518499, 68504, '<td valign="top">Magnificence here.  Not sure about the cropping- even cropping just at the top of the ears improves it in my whatever opinion, and gets the tip of the tail, part of a great dynamic diagonal, pointing at the top corner. It also emphasizes the horse''s lift off from the ground. Such a great capture of your horse, I hope you play with it some more. (No quarrels with the horse).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-31 16:12:40.</i></td>', 'Magnificence here.  Not sure about the cropping- even cropping just at the top of the ears improves it in my whatever opinion, and gets the tip of the tail, part of a great dynamic diagonal, pointing at the top corner. It also emphasizes the horse''s lift off from the ground. Such a great capture of your horse, I hope you play with it some more. (No quarrels with the horse).', '2007-05-31 17:07:59.000000', '2007-05-31 17:12:40.000000', 0),
(3720079, 518064, 69487, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by riversong:</b></div><hr/><i> Look at the fire coming out of the exhaust!  Wow. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Car runs a mild cam something near to what they call radical.  During downshifting the exhaust valves will open during combustion and the flames will blow out of the tail pipe.<br/> <br/>I hope to get a few captures like this later on.</td>', 'Originally posted by riversong: Look at the fire coming out of the exhaust!  Wow.   Car runs a mild cam something near to what they call radical.  During downshifting the exhaust valves will open during combustion and the flames will blow out of the tail pipe. I hope to get a few captures like this later on.', '2007-05-31 17:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
