(3726245, 518913, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing image. The expression on the boy''s face and the angle really make this shot. What probably hurt you scorewise is that the background is lighter than the subject. Not much you could do about that in basic editing, of course. Nicely seen, a definite keeper!</td>', 'This is an intriguing image. The expression on the boy''s face and the angle really make this shot. What probably hurt you scorewise is that the background is lighter than the subject. Not much you could do about that in basic editing, of course. Nicely seen, a definite keeper!', '2007-06-01 20:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726257, 518426, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and composed. The textures and colors are very strong. When I viewed this, I suspected it was a painting (I didn''t vote in this challenge), but it probably brought your score down some. Anyway, very cool.</td>', 'Nicely seen and composed. The textures and colors are very strong. When I viewed this, I suspected it was a painting (I didn''t vote in this challenge), but it probably brought your score down some. Anyway, very cool.', '2007-06-01 20:58:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726274, 517839, 66597, '<td valign="top">What a great capture of a fun moment! Has a candid feel. Certainly fits the username well. This would be stronger in advanced editing, of course, if you could light the faces more. But it''s still a fabulous capture and I sure your friends will enjoy it for years to come.</td>', 'What a great capture of a fun moment! Has a candid feel. Certainly fits the username well. This would be stronger in advanced editing, of course, if you could light the faces more. But it''s still a fabulous capture and I sure your friends will enjoy it for years to come.', '2007-06-01 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726304, 518114, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great idea, tough to capture :-) Did you use a high ISO on this? If you''d been able to lessen the grain (realize you couldn''t do it in post due to basic editing) it would have scored significantly higher.</td>', 'Great idea, tough to capture :-) Did you use a high ISO on this? If you''d been able to lessen the grain (realize you couldn''t do it in post due to basic editing) it would have scored significantly higher.', '2007-06-01 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726314, 516419, 66597, '<td valign="top">You did a great job with makeup, props and composition. Definitely looks like a hippy chick! The color temp looks warm and the focus might be a touch soft. Still a most worthy entry!</td>', 'You did a great job with makeup, props and composition. Definitely looks like a hippy chick! The color temp looks warm and the focus might be a touch soft. Still a most worthy entry!', '2007-06-01 21:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
