(3726322, 517689, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It has a candid feel, yet it is still polished. Especially intriguing how the face is cropped. And, as always, your tonal range in b/w is splendid. Frankly I think this should have scored much higher.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It has a candid feel, yet it is still polished. Especially intriguing how the face is cropped. And, as always, your tonal range in b/w is splendid. Frankly I think this should have scored much higher.', '2007-06-01 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726345, 516143, 66597, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge very well, and the colors are rich and focus sharp. I suspect the areas where the brick shows through hurt you scorewise, but a couple people loved it and gave you a 10!</td>', 'This fits the challenge very well, and the colors are rich and focus sharp. I suspect the areas where the brick shows through hurt you scorewise, but a couple people loved it and gave you a 10!', '2007-06-01 21:09:48.000000', NULL, 0),
