(3726402, 518428, 66597, '<td valign="top">This little guy is absolutely adorable! I like the contrast between the smooth fur of the bunny and the rough texture on the gloves. I think this should have scored a bit higher. Nicely done.</td>', 'This little guy is absolutely adorable! I like the contrast between the smooth fur of the bunny and the rough texture on the gloves. I think this should have scored a bit higher. Nicely done.', '2007-06-01 21:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726438, 518661, 66597, '<td valign="top">This does have a Man Ray feel, and I''m wondering if you''ve been using a star filter lately to get the great sunburst effects? I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have given you a decent score. The one thing that bothers me is that it feels skewed - as in an unlevel horizon. Realize it may be intentional. I like that you are stepping out and trying new things - you have an eye no matter where you go.</td>', 'This does have a Man Ray feel, and I''m wondering if you''ve been using a star filter lately to get the great sunburst effects? I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have given you a decent score. The one thing that bothers me is that it feels skewed - as in an unlevel horizon. Realize it may be intentional. I like that you are stepping out and trying new things - you have an eye no matter where you go.', '2007-06-01 21:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3726454, 518183, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect you achieved with this! I definitely learned something new by reading the description of how you took this photo. Now I''m going to have to try it! Very cool.</td>', 'I really like the effect you achieved with this! I definitely learned something new by reading the description of how you took this photo. Now I''m going to have to try it! Very cool.', '2007-06-01 21:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
