(3726885, 518603, 75713, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this photo to see what comments were made after voting... and I agree with everyone who said you should have been in the top 5 with this shot.. on my monitor the whites are perfectly exposed.. I am adding this to my favs.. thanks again for giving me such a good belly laugh!</td>', 'I had to come back to this photo to see what comments were made after voting... and I agree with everyone who said you should have been in the top 5 with this shot.. on my monitor the whites are perfectly exposed.. I am adding this to my favs.. thanks again for giving me such a good belly laugh!', '2007-06-01 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
