(4370762, 518112, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the border, but...<br/>The sense of motion you have captured here is glorious. :) I can just about <i>feel</i> the tremendous, rolling power and grace of the horse. Somehow the colors and high-contrast strenthen this impression, although I wonder how this would look with just slightly less contrast...Very beautiful!</td>', 'I personally don''t like the border, but...The sense of motion you have captured here is glorious. :) I can just about feel the tremendous, rolling power and grace of the horse. Somehow the colors and high-contrast strenthen this impression, although I wonder how this would look with just slightly less contrast...Very beautiful!', '2008-01-07 16:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4385763, 518422, 36499, '<td valign="top">this is pretty good! only suggestion i can make is try to dodge the petals of the flowers to lighten them up some, up the saturation(yellow)and play with the lightness a bit. this will help the yellow be as bright as the sky and give the photo a more even lighting look. gonna go play with this for a minute and see what I come up with...will PM u a link if it works like Im thinking...have a great night<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'this is pretty good! only suggestion i can make is try to dodge the petals of the flowers to lighten them up some, up the saturation(yellow)and play with the lightness a bit. this will help the yellow be as bright as the sky and give the photo a more even lighting look. gonna go play with this for a minute and see what I come up with...will PM u a link if it works like Im thinking...have a great night~~Cher~~', '2008-01-11 20:33:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4399277, 516167, 63267, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is phenominal.  I can''t beleive how awesome this photo looks.  The sky is wonderful and the detail in the backlit horse is just crazy.  This is a wonderful photo, great job in capturing and processing it.</td>', 'The lighting on this is phenominal.  I can''t beleive how awesome this photo looks.  The sky is wonderful and the detail in the backlit horse is just crazy.  This is a wonderful photo, great job in capturing and processing it.', '2008-01-17 07:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
